{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰冻之墓"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成伤害和冻结，并制造极寒领域施加霜冻。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","短暂蓄力后，选择一名敌人，对其造成240% + 20% ATK伤害，并冻结目标6秒。并在目标及其周围2格范围内制造极寒领域，领域内的敌人每2秒会被施加一次“霜冻”状态。优先选择周围2格敌人数量最多的敌人作为目标。每层“霜冻”会使其降低15急速，持续6秒，至多叠加3层。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","冻结时间延长至8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":2,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冰霜新星"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成一次小范围的伤害并施加霜冻。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对目标及其周围1格范围内的敌人造成一次155% + 15% ATK伤害，并施加一层“霜冻”。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/s